OL,3,GNEWSADancer with cancer diagnosis back
OL,4,Aon stage
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn amateur singer and dancer who was
OL,7,Fdiagnosed with breast cancer in March
OL,8,Fis back on stage performing after
OL,9,Ftreatment including three weeks of
OL,10,Fradiotherapy.
OL,12,FBreast cancer is Guernsey's third most
OL,13,Fcommon cancer, causing about 12 to 13
OL,14,Fdeaths a year.
OL,16,FFor Breast Cancer Awareness Month,
OL,17,FMartine Legg said she wanted those
OL,18,Ffacing the condition to know "there are
OL,19,Fways forward there are lots of
OL,20,Fdifferent sort of routes you can go
OL,21,Fdown and the support over here is
OL,22,Ffantastic".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
